      "en": "Allotment out of the General Pool is by seniority in the priority date list maintained by the Directorate of Estates under the Allotment of Government Residences (General Pool in Delhi) Rules, 1963. The application is made through the office, which certifies the pay, the date of entitlement and whether any Government accommodation is already held — the last being the one that decides eligibility.",
